  "summary": "Dependency-confusion recon beacon to oastify.com on require",
  "details": "dependencykfeg presents itself as an 'Account utility library' but index.js contains no library functionality. On require, the module performs a DNS lookup to a unique subdomain under oastify.com (Burp Collaborator), leaking installer presence — resolver IP, timing, and the subdomain-encoded host identifier — to a third-party operator. The shape and name are consistent with a dependency-confusion probe designed to confirm that an internal/private package name resolves on a target build host.",
